LUTAR-1#1 Warning
LUT drives async reset alert  
LUT cell l2/db_special1/state_reg_i_2, with 2 or more inputs, drives asynchronous preset/clear pin(s) l2/db_special1/state_reg/PRE. The LUT may glitch and trigger an unexpected reset, even if it is a properly timed path.
